# Use Gap Instead of SizedBox for Spacing

**Rule:** To keep code style consistent, use `Gap(...)` (from the `gap` package, already a dependency) to create spacing between widgets in a `Column` or `Row`, instead of `SizedBox(height: ...)` / `SizedBox(width: ...)`. `Gap` automatically infers the parent's axis.

### ❌ Bad Example
```dart
Column(
  children: [
    Text('Title'),
    SizedBox(height: 16),
    Text('Description'),
  ],
)
```

### ✅ Good Example
```dart
Column(
  children: [
    Text('Title'),
    Gap(16),
    Text('Description'),
  ],
)
```
